{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8000_place", "source_sha256": "d06f29f4ba7ec3bd67ac0359e94c2a131813275b930237b20eaceec7e0410703", "ja": "闇の大病院", "zh": "暗黑大医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8001_p", "source_sha256": "088e101300328d5abbc86c9699a6900b67a69e5a2aff623eeec285455a0ba0e7", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のコスプレグラビア\n企画で、雪歩は『闇病院で働くスタッフ』に扮する）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的角色扮演写真企划中，\n雪步装扮成了“在黑暗医院工作的工作人员”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "06573755ca7a2e1e67128e132eeeebbffe3a48d0ef4908423a1da5ba418fdf14", "ja": "うう……。{$P$}……\n本当にここで撮影するんですかぁ……？", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}……\n真的要在这里拍摄吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8003_p", "source_sha256": "882131c087dc3a65c5666e1c323bf0bd1232544bc6cd36410230722fc7a6a8d6", "ja": "ああ、闇の病院が舞台だからな。\nでも確かに……雰囲気もあって結構怖いよな。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟舞台是闹鬼的医院。\n不过确实……气氛也营造得很到位，挺吓人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6d384265b3938fc85a4fdbe9f16eeef5804256a6d4ecc46cca6a2996a896c963", "ja": "は、はい……。いい写真を撮るために、必要な\nロケーションなのはわかってるんですけど……。", "zh": "我、我知道这是为了拍出好照片所必需的取景地，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7da61d11c8fdd315567592e0cb326e0c124bcb6a011ae684c20ce24c3a22735d", "ja": "や、やっぱり、こんなの怖すぎますぅ……！\nす、スコップ……シャベルを……ドリルを……！", "zh": "可、可是，这也太吓人啦……！\n铲、铲子……铁锹……钻头在哪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8006_p", "source_sha256": "9d628a1950e4fe9454e65f00dbcebceaa58c5dbc7ccca60d212f5ed38dd978b1", "ja": "落ち着いてくれ、雪歩！\nさすがに病院の床は掘れないから。", "zh": "冷静一点，雪歩！\n毕竟医院的地板是挖不了的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7a903b47b083d1299c097eeeb39cc39f10f5f2d20bbe3c16e33c95360e1b7068", "ja": "はうぅ……{$P$}。\nでも……でも……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}。\n可是……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8008_p", "source_sha256": "37101e2ea7e3aa2c93c4d767973368d0a701bbf913e28eda17c9f87fb63ada98", "ja": "（うーん……。\nこれは何か声をかけてあげたほうがよさそうだ）", "zh": "（嗯……\n看来还是应该说点什么安慰她比较好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8009", "source_sha256": "0ec710e98b99ea781de20c22d817c5effb79f097d31fc656cc3314652d2060c4", "ja": "側で見守ってるから", "zh": "我会在旁边守望着你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8010", "source_sha256": "b8a5f0b771442bb3934c3a061319909eaa9f8553ccac5a96ce64f3c7f2fb2dee", "ja": "みんないるから大丈夫", "zh": "因为大家都在，所以没问题", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8011", "source_sha256": "1cff071299b646902efbf13d6177d6eaa081e39f00b36206391907ad8d8e6d2f", "ja": "わっ！", "zh": "哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e1c2402c36901cbe1f1989e67fb6b4b68eed22f868135c2425c73ecbf32021cf", "ja": "大丈夫。撮影中もずっと側で見てるから。\nそれにもしオバケが出てきても……俺が退治するよ！", "zh": "没事的。拍摄期间我也会一直陪在你身边看着你。\n而且就算真的有妖怪出来……我也一定会打倒它！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8101_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16aeb0d7313977fed3899dbcaa293626e6ed4c6d31957fa161a02b335fc13227", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nありがとうございますぅ！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n谢谢您～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8102_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2853e1d82949e14ff6ca97555114af428271d958420d7003b631660abb038088", "ja": "なんだか少し安心しました。もし本当に出てきても……\n私のこと、守ってくれるんだなあって。えへへ♪", "zh": "总觉得稍微放心了一些。就算真的出现了……\n你也会保护我呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8200_p", "source_sha256": "b5ec532631db20aec6ea6bce7ad04058f959cccd122889e93289fc017a8a10b7", "ja": "心配いらないよ。スタッフさんもいるし、\n雪歩一人ってわけじゃないから。", "zh": "不用担心。工作人员也在，\n又不是只有雪步你一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8201_004yuk", "source_sha256": "119250496a44b1da18eabc4407e1a58ea845e82d29e8923871a4fff0ff5201bf", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……！　みなさんが一緒なら、\n本当に出てきても、何とかなりますよね……！", "zh": "对、对啊……！大家都在一起的话，\n就算真的出来了，也一定能想办法应付过去吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8202_004yuk", "source_sha256": "607000e8666478088e9a8b0f1b807146c740683c36082204304017795cea6feb", "ja": "ふぅ……す、少し心が落ち着いてきたような……。\nこれなら、なんとか撮影もがんばれるかもですぅ！", "zh": "呼……好、好像稍微冷静一点了……。\n这样的话，说不定也能努力完成拍摄了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8300_p", "source_sha256": "1cff071299b646902efbf13d6177d6eaa081e39f00b36206391907ad8d8e6d2f", "ja": "わっ！", "zh": "哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3992f26a311092689760ec3f33f8fe87182343be1d19460f6d4bf6529e6e7b35", "ja": "はぅっ！？　な、なんですか……！？\nびっくりさせないでくださいぃ……。", "zh": "哈呜！？什、什么呀……！？\n请不要吓我呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8302_p", "source_sha256": "1b28c67a49100dba3fc304e09ad2849086408e94f5dc40381dc124cf74f605be", "ja": "ご、ごめん。怖さに慣れれば\n耐性がつくかもしれないと思って……。", "zh": "对、对不起。我只是觉得，要是习惯了恐怖，\n说不定就能变得更能承受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_8303_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d723bea199c1167b9dd6dffd9a828306e235686f81d433d741039de720eb9a48", "ja": "そ、そんなわけないじゃないですかぁ～！　ううっ……\nなんだか余計、怖さが増してきましたぁ……。", "zh": "才、才不是那样的呀～！呜呜……\n感觉反而变得更害怕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
